---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import KitchenGame from '../components/islands/KitchenGame';
import WaitlistCapture from '../components/islands/WaitlistCapture';
---

<Layout title="Play — Cafe Noor's Tuesday Shift" description="Three breakdowns, one morning shift, zero phone calls. See how Yaler's agent handles a real kitchen crisis in under 2 minutes.">
  <div class="space-y-6 py-2">
    <div class="space-y-2 text-center">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-mandate font-medium">Interactive demo</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl text-ink">Cafe Noor's Tuesday shift</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted max-w-md mx-auto">
        Three things break. Walk to each one. The agent handles the rest.
        <span class="block mt-1 text-xs text-ink/40">WASD or tap to move · Space or tap to interact</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <KitchenGame client:only="react" />

    <div class="paper-card rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">What you just played</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs text-ink-muted">
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <p class="text-ink font-medium">Event 1: Fridge</p>
          <p>In-budget quote. Agent auto-commits in Delegate mode. No human intervention needed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <p class="text-ink font-medium">Event 2: Hood</p>
          <p>Over-budget quote. Policy engine blocks. You choose: approve the overspend or reject and reroute to a cheaper option.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <p class="text-ink font-medium">Event 3: Gas line</p>
          <p>Regulated category. Policy engine escalates automatically to Gas Safe registered engineers only.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted border-t border-ink/10 pt-3">
        Every game step maps to a real system: mission creation, supplier discovery, offer comparison, policy enforcement, approval gates, rerouting, escalation, evidence verification, and proof receipts.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2 justify-center">
        <a href="/rehearsal" class="btn-primary text-sm py-2.5 px-5">Try the real thing</a>
        <a href="/" class="btn-secondary text-sm py-2.5 px-5">Back home</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Waitlist capture -->
    <WaitlistCapture client:load variant="game" source="play" />
  </div>
</Layout>
